    "raw_reply": "A [Chief Technology Officer (CTO)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chief_technology_officer) is a top executive in charge of a company's technology strategy and engineering, but they are not always the direct head of everyday internal IT operations.\u00a0[](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chief_technology_officer)\n\n- **The CTO:** Focuses outward and forward. They drive research, build tech products or software for customers, and plan long-term innovation.\u00a0[](https://www.forbes.com/sites/emmawoollacott/article/chief-technology-officer-cto/)\n\n- **The Head of IT (often the CIO or Chief Information Officer):** Focuses inward. They manage internal computer systems, employee help desks, day-to-day networks, and internal software.\u00a0[](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chief_technology_officer)\n\n### When the CTO Runs IT\n\n- In smaller companies or startups, one person often handles both roles.\n\n- The CTO might oversee the IT department simply because there is no separate CIO or IT Director.\n\n[](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chief_technology_officer)\n\nChief technology officer - Wikipedia\n\nA chief technology officer (CTO), chief technical officer, or chief technologist is a corporate officer tasked with managing techn...\n\n[](https://www.investopedia.com/terms/c/chief-technology-officer.asp)\n\nInvestopedia\n\nChief Technology Officer (CTO): Key Responsibilities and Role\n\nA chief technology officer (CTO) is a high-ranking executive who manages a company's technology and engineering departments. CTOs ...\n\n[](https://www.forbes.com/sites/emmawoollacott/article/chief-technology-officer-cto/)\n\nForbes\n\nWhat Is A Chief Technology Officer? CTO Role Explained\n\nA chief technology officer (CTO) is the head of technology for an organization. They are responsible for: \\* \\*\\*Managing IT and data...\n\n[](https://www.indeed.com/career-advice/finding-a-job/what-is-a-cto)\n\nIndeed\n\nWhat Is a CTO (Chief Technology Officer)? (Plus Salary) | Indeed.com\n\nKEY TAKEAWAYS: \\* A Chief Technology Officer (CTO) is responsible for overseeing the development and distribution of technology to ...\n\n[](https://www.evidi.com/techdictionary/chief-technology-officer-cto)\n\nEvidi\n\nChief Technology Officer (CTO) - Evidi\n\nChief Technology Officer (CTO) \\* Key responsibilities. Technology strategy: Develops long-term plans for technology growth and inn...",
